1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:03,900
The Prophet (peace be upon him) saw a girl in the house of Umm Salamah

2
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:05,600
and said a remarkable sentence about her.

3
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:08,760
The Prophet (peace be upon him) entered upon Umm Salamah (may Allah be pleased with her),

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,750
and in the house was a girl

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,980
with a mark on her face —

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,890
a yellowish pallor, a sign of illness.

7
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,130
The Prophet (peace be upon him) said:

8
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:17,430
“Seek ruqyah for her,

9
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,720
for she has been struck by the nazrah.”

10
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:20,100
That is, the evil eye had struck her.

11
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:22,110
As in Sahih al-Bukhari and Muslim.

12
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:25,560
The Prophet (peace be upon him) neither waited nor neglected the matter,

13
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,360
but ordered ruqyah at once.

14
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,250
This is a lesson from him to his Ummah:

15
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:30,850
do not take the evil eye lightly,

16
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,190
and do not delay protection and treatment,

17
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,580
but do not make every symptom an evil eye.

18
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:36,940
If the illness continues,

19
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,510
see a doctor alongside ruqyah.

20
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,200
Share this story with someone you love, and follow the channel.

